19-03
00:22:19.366 --> 00:22:22.033
Complete D one before continuing.

19-04
00:22:22.213 --> 00:22:27.013
Reset the synthetic example so the feed and property values are known.

19-05
00:22:27.193 --> 00:22:38.542
Check that evaluation temperature and reference temperature are three
hundred and fifty kelvin, and that total pressure and standard
pressure are one hundred kilopascals.

19-06
00:22:38.722 --> 00:22:41.858
