20-12
00:24:34.927 --> 00:24:42.202
They are not the initial feed and they are not the equilibrium
composition found by the extent solver.

20-13
00:24:42.382 --> 00:24:52.064
Those observations give Q equal to three point two at this temperature
and pressure, so they favor forward reaction relative to the selected
K.

20-14
00:24:52.244 --> 00:24:55.252
Leave the equilibrium assertion unchecked.

20-15
00:24:55.432 --> 00:25:02.895
Checking that box would label the supplied observations as claimed
