30-12
00:38:18.899 --> 00:38:21.501
Compare these with your reference row.

30-13
00:38:21.681 --> 00:38:25.244
Your final table now separates two changes.

30-14
00:38:25.424 --> 00:38:29.371
The pressure-only case changes extent while K stays fixed.

30-15
00:38:29.551 --> 00:38:32.985
